# Way of the Mind Sculptor draws a card when you activate a loyalty ability and removed two or more loyalty counters
# (CR 606.4, 603.4), and only for you. Bot1's Narset, Parter of Veils (-2: exactly the limit) draws on turn 3, the Jace
# token's -1 (just under it) draws nothing, and its -3 on turn 5 draws once for the trigger and once for the ability.
# Bot2's own Liliana of the Veil -2 on turn 4 removes two counters too, but it is not Bot1's activation, so Bot1 draws nothing.
# Narset's looking at cards (the default takes none) changes no hand. Bot1 draws one card a turn from turn 3 (skips turn 1).

